      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CORE · Notify (outbox sender)\n**Purpose**: send everything the bot says and system emails from the outbox: one in-flight message per chat, send-then-edit slots (cards, acks), merged batches, retries (429 retry_after, 5xx backoff), blocked-bot detection.\n**Trigger**: every 5 s + fast path.\n**Side effects**: outbox statuses, tg_message_slots, Telegram file ids.\n**Secrets**: the bot token is added by the egress proxy; Resend key is the credential.\n**TZ**: AP-1, IN-4, architecture 7.12.",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d4767d5e-6feb-5469-b8f7-8cc088dc71aa",
      "name": "Every 5 s",
